.TH SYS_CPU_COUNT 2 "March 2026" "Substrate" "System Calls Manual"
.SH NAME
sys_cpu_count \- return online CPU count
.SH LIBRARY
System library (libsys, \-lsys)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <sys/sysinfo.h>
.PP
.BI "int sys_cpu_count(void);"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.BR sys_cpu_count ()
returns the kernel's current online CPU count.
.SH RETURN VALUE
On success, a value >= 1 is returned.
.SH ERRORS
This call currently has no documented error path.
.SH NOTES
The kernel path uses SMP CPU-count reporting. A separate userspace helper in
`lib/sys/sysinfo.c` currently returns a constant 1 and should be aligned with
this syscall contract.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sys_proc_count (2),
.BR uname (2),
.BR sysinfo (2)
